{
  "id": "1459",
  "title": "What Is His Chinese Name?",
  "level": "elementary",
  "date": "2021-10-25",
  "synopsis": "Lucy is telling Little Yu about a handsome guy that she knows.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/1459/6d46a1d186be14bc9bddfbf9e269e1ca3856c87e.mp3?1633681030",
  "series": {
    "title": "Ben’s life in China 6: Maybe I Like Him",
    "chapter": 27,
    "totalChapters": 29
  },
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "他的中文名叫什么？\n\n露西：小雨，我明天要和那个帅哥一起去吃饭，你一起去吗？\n小雨：好啊！明天几点？\n露西：下午6点。\n小雨：好，没问题。真想快点到明天，好想见见你说的帅哥。对了，你的帅哥叫什么名字？\n露西：他叫Henry。\n小雨：他是哪国人？\n露西：中国人。\n小雨：中国人？他的中文名叫什么？\n露西：我不知道。",
    "traditional": "他的中文名叫什麼？\n\n露西：小雨，我明天要和那個帥哥一起去吃飯，你一起去嗎？\n小雨：好啊！明天幾點？\n露西：下午6點。\n小雨：好，沒問題。真想快點到明天，好想見見你說的帥哥。對了，你的帥哥叫什麼名字？\n露西：他叫Henry。\n小雨：他是哪國人？\n露西：中國人。\n小雨：中國人？他的中文名叫什麼？\n露西：我不知道。"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "What Is His Chinese Name?"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "露西：小雨，我明天要和那个帅哥一起去吃饭，你一起去吗？",
      "traditional": "露西：小雨，我明天要和那個帥哥一起去吃飯，你一起去嗎？",
      "pinyin": "lù xī xiǎo yǔ wǒ míng tiān yào hé nà ge shuài gē yì qǐ qù chī fàn nǐ yì qǐ qù ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lucy: Little Yu, I’m going out to eat with that handsome guy tomorrow. Do you want to come with us?"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "小雨：好啊！明天几点？",
      "traditional": "小雨：好啊！明天幾點？",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo yǔ hǎo a míng tiān jǐ diǎn",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Yu: Okay! What time tomorrow?"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "露西：下午6点。",
      "traditional": "露西：下午6點。",
      "pinyin": "lù xī xià wǔ 1 diǎn",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lucy: At 6 pm."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "小雨：好，没问题。真想快点到明天，",
      "traditional": "小雨：好，沒問題。真想快點到明天，",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo yǔ hǎo méi wèn tí zhēn xiǎng kuài diǎn dào míng tiān",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "好想见见你说的帅哥。对了，你的帅哥叫什么名字？",
      "traditional": "好想見見你說的帥哥。對了，你的帥哥叫什麼名字？",
      "pinyin": "hǎo xiǎng jiàn jiàn nǐ shuō de shuài gē duì le nǐ de shuài gē jiào shén me míng zi",
      "english": "Little Yu: Okay, no problem. I really want tomorrow to come a bit faster."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "I very much would like to meet your handsome guy. Oh, that’s right, what is your handsome guy’s name?"
    },
    {
